      <description>&lt;p&gt;This presentation will enable you to quantify the impact of purulent vaginal discharge and endometritis on the reproductive performance of dairy cows, choose diagnostic tools to identify these conditions, and propose a plan to assess reproductive health in a herd and mitigate the impact of reproductive tract conditions.&lt;/p&gt;
